              "correct": "Who's that?"
            },
            {
              "wrong": "He is our Math.",
              "correct": "He's our Math teacher."
            }
          ],
          "memory_tip": "Who's = Who is，问谁是谁。回答时，He's/She's 是缩写，更常用。",
